Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.18,0:00:21.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Nada cuesta 0.12 centavos\Nde dólar!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:27.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}«No puedes cambiar».\NEntonces, cabrón,
